      ": nosotros llenamos el cuarto, traemos el line-up y el arte digital, y las marcas involucradas ganan tráfico, usuarios y contenido, así como una experiencia inmersiva y diferente en la noche de evento.": ": we fill the room, bring the line-up and digital art, and the involved brands get traffic, users, and content, plus a different immersive experience on event night.",
      "DJ de la Ciudad de México. Presenta un set de house para la noche.": "Mexico City DJ. Presents a house set for the night.",
      "Uno de los destinos de vida nocturna más fuertes de la Ciudad de México, con una audiencia cultural comprobada. Owl Condesa ofrece una capacidad cuidada de 120 asistentes para una experiencia cercana y de alto contacto. La hospitalidad incluye cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes. Además, habilitamos hasta 120 lugares de guestlist sin costo para que PARTNER BRAND pueda sumar invitados propios. La exposición visual llega al cuarto completo.": "Owl Condesa is one of Mexico City's strongest nightlife venues, with a proven cultural audience. Owl Condesa offers a curated 120-person capacity for a close, high-touch experience. Hospitality includes beer + canapés for up to 120 attendees. We also enable up to 120 guestlist spots so PARTNER BRAND can bring its own guests. Visual exposure reaches the full room.",
      "Capacidad: 120 asistentes. La hospitalidad contempla cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes.": "Capacity: 120 attendees. Hospitality includes beer + canapés for up to 120 attendees.",
      "Habilitamos hasta 120 lugares de guestlist sin costo para que PARTNER BRAND pueda sumar invitados propios.": "Up to 150 free guestlist spots so PARTNER BRAND can bring its own guests.",
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Beer + canapés stay limited. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app download, KYC validation, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, beer + canapés rewards, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Hospitality includes beer + canapés for up to 120 attendees. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app download, KYC validation, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, beer + canapés rewards, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa."
