      "Final activation details with PARTNER BRAND": "Detalles finales por definir con PARTNER BRAND",
      "PARTNER BRAND gains new users through a real-world experience people remember. We build a PARTNER BRAND flow so attendees claim drink credits, redeem them on site, and pay with PARTNER BRAND Card, PARTNER BRAND Pay, or PARTNER BRAND.": "PARTNER BRAND activa nuevos usuarios mediante una experiencia real y memorable. Construimos un PARTNER BRAND flow para que los asistentes reclamen créditos de bebida, canjeen en sitio y paguen con PARTNER BRAND Card, PARTNER BRAND Pay o PARTNER BRAND.",
      "PARTNER BRAND gains new users through a real-world experience people remember. Owl Condesa hosts up to 120 attendees for a close, high-touch experience. The drink redemption is limited to 100 guests, so it feels scarce, targeted, and worth completing an action for. We build a PARTNER BRAND flow so attendees claim drink credits, redeem on site, and pay with PARTNER BRAND Card, PARTNER BRAND Pay, or PARTNER BRAND.": "PARTNER BRAND activa nuevos usuarios mediante una experiencia real y memorable. Owl Condesa ofrece una capacidad cuidada de 120 asistentes para una experiencia cercana y de alto contacto. La hospitalidad incluye cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes. Construimos un PARTNER BRAND flow para que los asistentes reclamen créditos de bebida, canjeen en sitio y paguen con PARTNER BRAND Card, PARTNER BRAND Pay o PARTNER BRAND.",
      "PARTNER BRAND brings users into a real-world football experience people remember. Guests enter PARTNER BRAND Challenges, take a match position, and can use PARTNER BRAND Card for on-site cashback moments. Owl Condesa hosts up to 120 attendees for a close, high-touch experience. Drink redemption stays limited, so the action feels scarce and targeted.": "PARTNER BRAND activa usuarios mediante una experiencia futbolera real y memorable. Los asistentes entran a PARTNER BRAND Challenges, toman una posicion de partido y pueden usar PARTNER BRAND Card para momentos de cashback en sitio. Owl Condesa ofrece una capacidad cuidada de 120 asistentes para una experiencia cercana y de alto contacto. El canje de cerveza + canapés se mantiene limitado para que se sienta escaso y dirigido.",
      "No PARTNER BRAND app, no claim. Guests enter PARTNER BRAND Challenges, take a match position, validate with staff, and then claim the beer + canapés benefit credit.": "Sin app, no hay acceso ni bebida. Los invitados deben usar PARTNER BRAND app, completar la acción en PARTNER BRAND Challenges en sitio y después reclamar el crédito de bebida.",
