      "One Sala Principal takeover night. You get PARTNER BRAND app onboarding, a PARTNER BRAND flow, drink credits, PARTNER BRAND Card and PARTNER BRAND Pay moments, PARTNER BRAND visuals, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participations, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. Acceso por PARTNER BRAND app, PARTNER BRAND flow, cr?ditos de bebida, momentos con PARTNER BRAND Card y PARTNER BRAND Pay, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, acciones en PARTNER BRAND Challenges y documentaci?n dentro de Owl Condesa.",
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Drink redemptions stay limited. You get PARTNER BRAND app onboarding, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, PARTNER BRAND Card education, PARTNER BRAND Pay reward moments, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. La exposicion llega al cuarto completo. Hasta 120 creditos de bebida. Acceso por PARTNER BRAND app, PARTNER BRAND flow, momentos con PARTNER BRAND Card y PARTNER BRAND Pay, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, acciones en PARTNER BRAND Challenges y documentacion dentro de Owl Condesa.",
