      "One Sala Principal takeover night. You get PARTNER BRAND app onboarding, a PARTNER BRAND flow, drink credits, PARTNER BRAND Card and PARTNER BRAND Pay moments, PARTNER BRAND visuals, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participations, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. Acceso por PARTNER BRAND app, PARTNER BRAND flow, cr\u00e9ditos de bebida, momentos con PARTNER BRAND Card y PARTNER BRAND Pay, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, acciones en PARTNER BRAND Challenges y documentaci\u00f3n dentro de Owl Condesa.",
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Drink redemptions stay limited. You get PARTNER BRAND app onboarding, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, PARTNER BRAND Card education, PARTNER BRAND Pay reward moments, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. La exposici\u00f3n llega al cuarto completo. Hasta 120 cr\u00e9ditos de bebida. Acceso por PARTNER BRAND app, PARTNER BRAND flow, momentos con PARTNER BRAND Card y PARTNER BRAND Pay, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, acciones en PARTNER BRAND Challenges y documentaci\u00f3n dentro de Owl Condesa.",
      "PARTNER BRAND brings users into a real-world football experience people remember. Guests tap AXIS NFC, enter PARTNER BRAND Challenges, take a match position, and can use PARTNER BRAND Card for on-site cashback moments. Owl Condesa hosts up to 120 attendees for a close, high-touch experience. Beer + canapés stay limited, with a beer first and an PARTNER BRAND shot as the second reward layer.": "PARTNER BRAND activa usuarios mediante una experiencia futbolera real y memorable. Los invitados tocan el NFC de AXIS, entran a PARTNER BRAND Challenges, toman una posicion de partido y pueden usar PARTNER BRAND Card para momentos de cashback en sitio. Owl Condesa ofrece una capacidad cuidada de 120 asistentes para una experiencia cercana y de alto contacto. La hospitalidad contempla cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes.",
      "No PARTNER BRAND app, no claim. Guests tap AXIS NFC, enter the PARTNER BRAND mission, validate with staff, receive a beer + canapés benefit, and redeem first a beer, then an PARTNER BRAND shot reward layer.": "Sin PARTNER BRAND app no hay canje. Los invitados tocan el NFC de AXIS, entran a la mision PARTNER BRAND, validan con staff, reciben un ticket de bebida y canjean primero una cerveza; despues, el shot PARTNER BRAND como segunda recompensa.",
      "Beer + canapés": "Cerveza + canapés",
      "Beer + canapés": "Ticket de bebida",
      "AXIS NFC mission entry": "NFC de AXIS hacia misiones",
      "PARTNER BRAND missions": "Misiones PARTNER BRAND",
      "Ticket validation": "Validacion de tickets",
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Beer + canapés stay limited. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app onboarding, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, PARTNER BRAND Card education, PARTNER BRAND Pay reward moments, PARTNER BRAND visuals, beer plus PARTNER BRAND shot rewards, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. La exposicion llega al cuarto completo. La hospitalidad contempla cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes. Incluye NFC de AXIS hacia misiones PARTNER BRAND, onboarding de PARTNER BRAND app, participacion en PARTNER BRAND Challenges, educacion de PARTNER BRAND Card, momentos de recompensa con PARTNER BRAND Pay, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, cerveza mas shot PARTNER BRAND, captura de contenido y documentacion dentro de Owl Condesa.",
      "PARTNER BRAND brings users into a real-world football experience people remember. Guests arrive, tap AXIS NFC, and start the PARTNER BRAND mission. Downloading PARTNER BRAND app and completing KYC unlocks beer. Participating in the PARTNER BRAND Challenges contest unlocks canapés.": "PARTNER BRAND activa usuarios mediante una experiencia futbolera real y memorable. Los invitados llegan, tocan el NFC de AXIS e inician la mision PARTNER BRAND. Descargar PARTNER BRAND app y completar KYC desbloquea la cerveza. Participar en el concurso de PARTNER BRAND Challenges desbloquea la canapés.",
      "Two separate reward gates: app download + KYC earns the first drink; PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation earns the second drink.": "Dos puertas de recompensa separadas: descargar la app + KYC gana la primera bebida; participar en PARTNER BRAND Challenges gana la segunda bebida.",
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Beer + canapés stay limited. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app download, KYC validation, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, beer + canapés rewards, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. La exposicion llega al cuarto completo. La hospitalidad contempla cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes. Incluye entrada por NFC de AXIS, descarga de PARTNER BRAND app, validacion KYC, participacion en PARTNER BRAND Challenges, recompensas de cerveza + canapés, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, captura de contenido y documentacion dentro de Owl Condesa."
,
      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Hospitality includes beer + canapés for up to 120 attendees. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app download, KYC validation, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, beer + canapés rewards, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Una noche de takeover del Sala Principal. La exposición llega al cuarto completo. La hospitalidad contempla cerveza + canapés para hasta 120 asistentes. Incluye entrada por NFC de AXIS, descarga de PARTNER BRAND app, validación KYC, participación en PARTNER BRAND Challenges, recompensas de cerveza + canapés, visuales de PARTNER BRAND, captura de contenido y documentación dentro de Owl Condesa."
