      "One Sala Principal takeover night. Exposure reaches the full room. Hospitality includes beer + canapés for up to 120 attendees. You get AXIS NFC mission entry, PARTNER BRAND app download, KYC validation, PARTNER BRAND Challenges participation, beer + canapés rewards, PARTNER BRAND visuals, content capture, and documentation inside Owl Condesa.": "Sala Principal 一晚接管。视觉曝光覆盖整个房间。最多 100 张饮品票券与 PARTNER BRAND 的初始想法对齐，最多 150 个免费嘉宾名单名额可供 PARTNER BRAND 嘉宾使用。内容包括 AXIS NFC 任务入口、PARTNER BRAND app 下载、KYC 验证、PARTNER BRAND Challenges 参与、两次独立饮品奖励、PARTNER BRAND 视觉、内容拍摄以及 Owl Condesa 内的完整记录。",
